        "html": "\n        <div class=\"cover-royal\">\n          <div class=\"cover-header-ornament\">❖ ❖ ❖</div>\n          <div class=\"cover-title-group\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #d4af37; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 2px;\">الوثيقة التاريخية الكبرى</div>\n            <h1>مَلْحَمَةُ دَرْب</h1>\n            <h2>السِّيرَةُ التَّقْنِيَّةُ وَالقِصَّةُ الكَامِلَةُ لِبِنَاءِ المَنْظُومَة</h2>\n            <div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #9bb7e0; margin-top: 5px;\">مِنْ شَرَارَةِ الفِكْرَةِ.. إِلَى مَعَانَقَةِ السَّحَاب</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"cover-emblem-wrap\">\n            \n  <svg class=\"cover-logo-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"66\" height=\"66\">\n    <defs>\n      <linearGradient id=\"pathGrad\" x1=\"50%\" y1=\"100%\" x2=\"50%\" y2=\"0%\">\n        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#3b82f6\" stop-opacity=\"0.2\"/>\n        <stop offset=\"40%\" stop-color=\"#60a5fa\"/>\n        <stop offset=\"85%\" stop-color=\"#38bdf8\"/>\n        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#fef08a\"/>\n      </linearGradient>\n      <linearGradient id=\"bookLeft\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"50%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"50%\">\n        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#1d4ed8\"/>\n        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#3b82f6\"/>\n      </linearGradient>\n      <linearGradient id=\"bookRight\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"50%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"50%\">\n        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#3b82f6\"/>\n        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#2563eb\"/>\n      </linearGradient>\n      <linearGradient id=\"goldGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\n        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fef08a\"/>\n        <stop offset=\"40%\" stop-color=\"#eab308\"/>\n        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#ca8a04\"/>\n      </linearGradient>\n      <filter id=\"starGlow\" x=\"-50%\" y=\"-50%\" width=\"200%\" height=\"200%\">\n        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"16\" result=\"blur1\"/>\n        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" resu